docs {
  Mainframe source: claim 202612784390001; 13-digit key 8432612790001; request date 20260508; schedule ASCOP; claim status 1005; pricing type ASC.
  Confirmed source lines: 0001 CPT 26951 billed 6000.00 / allowed 2848.38; 0002 CPT 30140 billed 2500.00 / allowed 1281.87. Expected NC is 3151.62 and 1218.13 respectively; claim-level submitted allowed total is 4130.25 and NC total is 4369.75.
  Service date raw 501 normalized to 20260501. Mainframe revenue value -300 represented as revenueCode 00300, consistent with the collection's existing mapping. Diagnosis R6889, provider, member, plan, network IDs, MMM 7 and CCN N are source-backed.
  PARTIAL: service detail also lists CPT 26951 billed 1250.00 on raw date 502, but the filtered pricing export has no matching allowed amount for it; it is omitted rather than guessed. POS and modifiers are null in the extract; POS sent blank. Ratesheet/rule details are not populated by the source; pricingRules remains blank. Provider/member network labels and provider specialty/address sequence remain template values where not exposed in the extract.
}
